%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7d52d21a72ca374996a821ea5a856cc, type: 3}
  m_Name: DT_Shelter_Pat
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTree
  startNodeID: start
  nodes:
  - nodeID: start
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: Morning. Breakfast is on until half seven. You will need to be
      out by eight for school. You doing okay today?
    choices:
    - choiceText: Yeah I'm fine thanks
      nextNodeID: fine
      ehcEffect:
        energyDelta: 0
        hopeDelta: 10
        connectionDelta: 0
    - choiceText: I'm really tired
      nextNodeID: tired
      ehcEffect:
        energyDelta: -15
        hopeDelta: 0
        connectionDelta: 0
    - choiceText: Do I have to leave so early?
      nextNodeID: early
      ehcEffect:
        energyDelta: 0
        hopeDelta: -10
        connectionDelta: 0
  - nodeID: fine
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: Good to hear. Make sure you eat something before you go. A long
      day is harder on an empty stomach. You have got school today yeah?
    choices:
    - choiceText: Yeah
      nextNodeID: school_yes
      ehcEffect:
        energyDelta: 0
        hopeDelta: 10
        connectionDelta: 0
    - choiceText: I don't really want to go
      nextNodeID: school_no
      ehcEffect:
        energyDelta: 0
        hopeDelta: -15
        connectionDelta: 0
  - nodeID: tired
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: I know. It is not easy sleeping here. You are doing well though,
      honestly. A lot of kids your age would not manage half as well as you do.
    choices: []
  - nodeID: early
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: I am afraid so. Rules of the shelter. But you know you can always
      talk to me right? That is what I am here for. Not just the rules and the breakfast.
    choices:
    - choiceText: Thanks Pat
      nextNodeID: thanks
      ehcEffect:
        energyDelta: 0
        hopeDelta: 20
        connectionDelta: 20
    - choiceText: I'm fine honestly
      nextNodeID: fine_brush
      ehcEffect:
        energyDelta: 0
        hopeDelta: 0
        connectionDelta: -5
  - nodeID: school_yes
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: Good. School is important. It is the one normal thing you have
      got right now. Hold onto that.
    choices: []
  - nodeID: school_no
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: I get it. But go anyway. Some days you just have to show up. That
      counts for something.
    choices: []
  - nodeID: thanks
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: Anytime. Now go eat something before it is all gone.
    choices: []
  - nodeID: fine_brush
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: Alright. Door is open if that changes.
    choices: []
